  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institute for Integrated Transitions - IFIT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project plans to identify the exact issues at stake between the Bassa and Egbura peoples, distil the precise 
interests of each group, and build elite/stakeholder consensus around a common agenda for the talks.
This will be achieved by outreaching to both sides with the goal of reinforcing elite consensus around a need for a 
negotiated settlement. Furthermore, the project will carry out shuttle mediation with key women, youth and community leaders of the two groups to distil their precise interests.</narrative>
  </description>
